    "history": [
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U01",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "我第一次进固定队试训，想练一下辅助位怎么报信息才不盖住指挥。先帮我分清哪些得马上说，哪些能等打完再补。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-001-feedback-U01-7237c0bd63df",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "可以按“会不会影响队友接下来几秒的决策”来分。\n\n必须马上说",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-001",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "可以按“会不会影响队友接下来几秒的决策”来分。\n\n必须马上说的：\n\n第一，直接威胁。比如“右侧绕后一个”“我被切”“对面刺客没露头”。\n\n第二，关键技能和资源。比如“对面大招交了”“他没闪”“我治疗还有五秒”。只报会改变集火、撤退或开团判断的。\n\n第三，你自己的状态变化。比如“我跟不上”“我没技能，保不了”“我能接控制”。别只说“没了”，要说清什么没了。\n\n第四，视野和人数。比如“左边看到两个”“正面少一人”“后点丢视野”。位置、人数、动向尽量一句说完。\n\n第五，指挥要求的信息。指挥问你技能、位置或能不能跟，要优先立刻回答。\n\n可以等打完再补的：\n\n操作失误、谁该背锅、完整复盘",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U02",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "先停一下，例子别铺太多，直接给我一个判断要不要立刻插话的标准。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-002",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "标准就一个：这条信息如果会改变队友接下来三秒的操作，就立刻说；不会，就等指挥空档或打完再补。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U03",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "那视野变化如果会影响眼前这波，我就算听见队长还在说，也只插一句对象和状态，对吧？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-003",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "对。会影响眼前这波就立刻插一句，只报“对象加状态”，必要时再带位置，比如“对面打野右侧消失”。说完就停，把频道还给队长。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U04",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "报我自己的保护技能时呢，是先讲技能状态，还是先解释这波能不能保？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-004-feedback-U04-f6f5ebba518c",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "先说结论，也就是能不能保，再补关键状态。比如：“保不了，治疗还有五秒”或者“能保",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U04",
        "kind": "backchannel",
        "content": "明白。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-004",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "先说结论，也就是能不能保，再补关键状态。比如：“保不了，治疗还有五秒”或者“能保，有大”。队友先听到可执行信息，指挥更容易马上决策。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U05",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "我上次有个真误报，我捋一下，当时先说成对面辅助没闪，后来才想起来其实是对面AD交闪，辅助没交。这个该怎么立刻改口？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-005",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "立刻说：“更正，刚才",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U06",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "我直接试一下：更正，刚才对象报反了，是对面AD交闪，辅助没交闪。这样够短吗？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-006",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "够短，也很清楚。还能再压成：“更正，AD没闪，辅助有闪。”",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U07",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "好，先换到提建议这块。我有个关键想法，但中单在做主决策时，怎么说才不像在抢指挥？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-007-feedback-U07-7113afaeba2a",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "用“建议＋一句依据＋把决定权还给他”。\n\n比",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U07",
        "kind": "backchannel",
        "content": "嗯。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-007",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "用“建议＋一句依据＋把决定权还给他”。\n\n比如：“建议先撤，对面绕后没露",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U08",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "这个还是有点长，真打起来我不想解释一串理由，帮我压成一句就行。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-008",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "一句就说：“建议先撤，你定。”",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U09",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "如果指挥明确否了，我该怎么收住？我不想下意识再争一句。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-009",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "就回一句：“收到，按你的来。”然后立刻执行，不再补理由。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U10",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "那要是没人回应，不一定是被否了吧？什么情况下我才值得再报一次？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-010-feedback-U10-98836c5cbdd2",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "没人回应不等于否决。",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U10",
        "kind": "backchannel",
        "content": "嗯嗯。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-010",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "没人回应不等于否决。只有信息仍然有效、会影响接下来三秒，而且不处理会出事，才再报一次。第二次只说结论并加急迫性，比如“再报一次，必须撤”。说完就停；还没回应，就按现有指挥执行。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U11",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "行，回到整套试训语音吧。按开口时机、怎么说、说完怎么让位，给我压成一个短检查顺序，我上场前过一遍。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-011-feedback-U11-b0a0aeb4937e",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "上场前记三步：\n\n第一，判时机：会不会影响队友接下来三秒？会",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U11",
        "kind": "backchannel",
        "content": "明白。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-011",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "上场前记三步：\n\n第一，判时机：会不会影响队友接下来三秒？会就报，不会就等。\n\n第二，报结论：对象加状态，先说能不能做；提建议就说“建议这样，你定”。\n\n第三，让频道：说完就停。被否就“收到，按你的来”；只有危险仍紧迫，才再报一次。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U11",
        "kind": "end",
        "content": "好，清楚了，谢谢。"
      }
    ]
  },
